  "producer_changes": [
    "Semantic contract format3: normalize type-reference proof prose/revisions out of structured field/supertype hashes; retain type parameters, declared supertypes/dependencies, direction, known wire annotations, inherited oneway and HIDL results. No format2 grants/codecs silently retarget.",
    "Owner annotation-erasure-source011 integrated exact descriptor changes+11tests;268additional matches/119permission annotations/578remaining only prospective",
    "Owner permission_reference documentation importer retained; constants never treated as manifest definitions;5fixtures",
    "Canonical entity_kind rejects missing/future unknown kinds explicitly; structured AIDL/HIDL fields/types are inventory rather than generated invocation aliases"
  ],
  "consumer_changes": [
    "Effective registry+overlay capture in one read transaction; retain base/local/suppressed/conflict/deleted nodes and generation/revision pins; field overrides update enclosing structured type contract and dependent schema closure",
    "Existence state is separate from catalog_state and client grants; known-route admission rejects globally suppressed bindings/types, stale/mismatched effective metadata documents and stale views; matching Allow and live-authority cases tested",
    "Resolved3 carries catalog_document_sha256; generated aliases check the exact effective document, final schema and graph pins. Base-only inventories cannot supply current aliases without effective metadata capture.",
    "Verified wire codecs need nonempty codec_id, matching schema_hash and evidence; wire tuple uniqueness/uint32 checks; normalized available dependency edge index supports bounded runtime traversal"
  ],
